msgid "Why Choose Rubi Cleaning?"
msgstr "Miks valida Rubi Cleaning?"

msgid "We combine reliability, experience and eco-conscious care to deliver spotless results every time."
msgstr "Ühendame usaldusväärsuse, kogemuse ja keskkonnateadlikkuse, et tulemus oleks alati laitmatu."

msgid "Contact Us Today"
msgstr "Võta meiega ühendust"

msgid "Explore our professional cleaning services — designed to make your space spotless and stress-free."
msgstr "Tutvuge meie professionaalsete koristusteenustega – et teie ruumid oleksid puhtad ja mure oleks väiksem."

msgid "What We Offer"
msgstr "Mida pakume"

msgid "From one-time deep cleans to ongoing maintenance, our expert team has you covered."
msgstr "Ühekordsest suurpuhastusest püsiva hoolduseni – meie meeskond aitab."

msgid "Looking for a Custom Service?"
msgstr "Otsite eriteenust?"

msgid "We offer tailored cleaning for your home or business. Get in touch today and let’s make your space shine."
msgstr "Pakume teie kodule või ettevõttele kohandatud koristust. Võtke ühendust ja paneme teie ruumid särama."

msgid "Please read our terms before booking our cleaning services."
msgstr "Palun lugege meie tingimused enne koristusteenuse broneerimist läbi."

msgid "Agreement"
msgstr "Kokkulepe"

msgid "By booking Rubi Cleaning services, you agree to these terms. All bookings are subject to availability and confirmation."
msgstr "Rubi Cleaningu teenuseid broneerides nõustute nende tingimustega. Kõik broneeringud sõltuvad vabadest aegadest ja vajavad kinnitust."

msgid "Prices and Payment"
msgstr "Hinnad ja maksmine"

msgid "Prices are in euros (EUR). Prices on the website are starting prices; the final price is confirmed before the work begins. Invoices are paid by bank transfer within the stated due date."
msgstr "Hinnad on eurodes (EUR). Veebilehel toodud hinnad on alghinnad; lõplik hind lepitakse kokku enne töö algust. Arved tasutakse pangaülekandega märgitud maksetähtajaks."

msgid "Cancellations"
msgstr "Tühistamine"

msgid "You may cancel free of charge up to 24 hours before your appointment. Late cancellations may incur a fee to cover staff and scheduling costs."
msgstr "Broneeringu saab tasuta tühistada kuni 24 tundi enne kokkulepitud aega. Hilisema tühistamise korral võib rakenduda tasu töötajate ja planeerimise kulude katmiseks."

msgid "Quality Guarantee"
msgstr "Kvaliteedigarantii"

msgid "If you are not satisfied with any part of the cleaning, let us know within 24 hours and we will return to fix it free of charge."
msgstr "Kui te pole mõne koristuse osaga rahul, andke meile teada 24 tunni jooksul ja tuleme selle tasuta parandama."

msgid "Liability"
msgstr "Vastutus"

msgid "We are insured for the work we carry out. Rubi Cleaning is not liable for pre-existing damage or normal wear and tear."
msgstr "Meie tehtud töö on kindlustatud. Rubi Cleaning ei vastuta varasemate kahjustuste ega tavapärase kulumise eest."

msgid "For further information, reach us via our"
msgstr "Lisateabe saamiseks võtke meiega ühendust:"

